  "claim": "The film in which the daughter of Shashi Kapoor, along side Sarat Pujari and Navni Parihar was set in Orissa.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Aranyaka (film). Sentence: Aranyaka (A Trip Into the Jungle) is a 1994 Indian Hindi drama film directed by Apurba Kishore Bir.\nPage: Aranyaka (film). Sentence: The film stars Sarat Pujari, Navni Parihar, Sanjana Kapoor and Mohan Gokhale in lead roles.\nPage: Aranyaka (film). Sentence: Based on a short story \"Aranyaka\" by Manoj Das, the film is set in rural Orissa, where a formal local ruler organizes a hunt for his invited guests, which goes wrong.\nPage: Sanjana Kapoor. Sentence: Sanjna Kapoor (born 27 November 1967) is an Indian theatre personality and former Indian film actress of British and Indian descent.\nPage: Sanjana Kapoor. Sentence: She is the daughter of Shashi Kapoor and the late Jennifer Kendal.",
