        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Apurba Kishore Bir, Sarat Pujari, Navni Parihar, Sanjana Kapoor, Mohan Gokhale, Manoj Das, Shashi Kapoor, Jennifer Kendal\n- Works: Aranyaka (film), \"Aranyaka\" (short story)\n- Places: India, rural Orissa\n- Topics: Hindi drama films, theatre, film acting, family relationships\n\nFacts:\n- Sanjana Kapoor was born on 27 November 1967.\n- Sanjana Kapoor is an Indian theatre personality and former film actress of British and Indian descent.\n- Sanjana Kapoor is the daughter of Shashi Kapoor and Jennifer Kendal.\n- Aranyaka is a 1994 Indian Hindi drama film directed by Apurba Kishore Bir.\n- Aranyaka stars Sarat Pujari, Navni Parihar, Sanjana Kapoor, and Mohan Gokhale in lead roles.\n- Aranyaka is based on the short story \"Aranyaka\" by Manoj Das.\n- Aranyaka is set in rural Orissa, where a local ruler organizes a hunt for invited guests that goes wrong.",
